<ProseLayout
  title="Credits"
  description="Photo credits, font and icon attribution, and open-source acknowledgments for this site."
  eyebrow="Credits"
  intro="The people, photos, and open-source projects that make this site possible."
>
  <h2>Photography</h2>
  <p>
    Photographs on this site are either original work by village volunteers,
    contributed by residents, or used under a Creative Commons license.
  </p>

  <h3>Historical photograph of Midvale (homepage hero)</h3>
  <p>
    The black-and-white panoramic photograph of Midvale featured on the homepage
    is a historical image from a private collection. The original date and
    photographer are unknown.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>If you can identify the source, photographer, or approximate date
    of this photograph, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a></strong> so we can
    credit it properly. We will update this page promptly with attribution
    information once it is verified.
  </p>

  <h2>Typography</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Source Serif 4</strong> by Adobe, released under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.</li>
    <li><strong>Source Sans 3</strong> by Adobe, released under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Icons</h2>
